WEBVTT

00:04:27.096 --> 00:04:30.808
eventually enrolling
more than 2,500 employees.

00:04:31.183 --> 00:04:33.019
The results have been remarkable.

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:35.688
Physical and mental stress went down

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:38.524
while work ethic, job satisfaction,

00:04:38.566 --> 00:04:41.944
work-life balance,
energy levels, all improved.

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:46.365
Productivity and service quality
stayed the same or got better,

00:04:46.365 --> 00:04:48.784
and the trial was revenue-neutral.

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:54.332
Today, roughly 85 percent
of all Icelandic employees

00:04:54.373 --> 00:04:57.710
are either on or eligible
for these schedules.

00:04:58.085 --> 00:05:02.381
